  dialogue:
  - Just who do you think you are talking to?! I don't work day and night, overseeing
    hundreds of thousands...
  - of users on my dedicated servers, only to be so blatantly insulted by a low life
    such as yourself!
  - Why don't you take a look at yourself in the mirror and answer me this?
  - '"Do I look nearly as good looking as the man in front of me?"'
  - 'Nope. No need to answer it. '
  - I already know what form of an answer a mindless troglodyte such as yourself
    would utter.
